3
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">hikarabita kotoba wo tsunai de</font></font></b></font></font>

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">connecting old words that have<font color="#ffffff"> been used up</font></font></font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The smell is moving away...</font>

26
00:01:58,130 --> 00:02:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saved...</font>

27
00:02:02,010 --> 00:02:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is?</font>

28
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please wait!</font>

29
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:20,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real deal... starts now!</font>

30
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My role now is to stall this person
as long as possible...</font>

31
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I should've avoided big techniques
that could be self-defeating...</font>

32
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it seems this isn't an opponent
easy enough to beat</font>

33
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without using my Secret Technique...</font>

34
00:02:42,510 --> 00:02:43,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

35
00:02:44,850 --> 00:02:48,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just had surgery
and am not at my best...</font>

36
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if it'd just be opening the first of the
Eight Inner Gates the Gate of Opening</font>

37
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should somehow...</font>

38
00:02:56,690 --> 00:02:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first gate... The Gate of Opening...</font>

39
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open!</font>

40
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Primary Lotus!</font>

41
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The impact of the kick
was suppressed by the bones...?!</font>

42
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:19,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's some speed... But it's over.</font>

43
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... No matter how much I think,
I can't come up with any good strategies...!</font>

44
00:03:27,010 --> 00:03:30,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had it... can't hold any further...</font>

45
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With me right in front of you,
you can't even howl like a loser...?</font>

46
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:39,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

47
00:03:40,490 --> 00:03:41,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

48
00:03:42,610 --> 00:03:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mine!</font>

49
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you be smiling
before you're going to die!</font>

50
00:03:57,500 --> 00:03:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

51
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?!</font>

52
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you're an ally this time...</font>

53
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?!</font>

54
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Sand...</font>

55
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi...</font>

56
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ally of the Leaf!</font>

57
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:44,010
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Leaf Village's Ally Nation</font>

58
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:44,010
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the Ninja of the Sand</font>

59
00:04:58,190 --> 00:05:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand...?! Am I still drunk...?</font>

60
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara of the Desert...</font>

61
00:05:25,170 --> 00:05:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara.</font>

62
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:31,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that who you are?</font>

63
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Digital Shrapnel!</font>

64
00:05:59,710 --> 00:06:02,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he blow the finger tip bones...?!</font>

65
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impetuous...</font>

66
00:06:20,730 --> 00:06:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

67
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:28,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you fought me...
you had more speed and sharpness.</font>

68
00:06:32,910 --> 00:06:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Easy to say...</font>

69
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:39,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that I'm holding a grudge...</font>

70
00:06:39,670 --> 00:06:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But on account of you,
I had kind of a tough time of it.</font>

71
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

72
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:56,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... why you...?</font>

73
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:00,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I owe a lot...</font>

74
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the Leaf.</font>

75
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:08,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

76
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that we'd made up
with the Sand traitors...</font>

77
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:22,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to think you'd change
this abruptly...</font>

78
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like we attacked the Leaf
for the fun of it...</font>

79
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was an order...</font>

80
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the same way
that I'm here now.</font>

81
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. The Fifth Hokage
asked the Sand...</font>

82
00:07:38,220 --> 00:07:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a big help.</font>

83
00:07:40,730 --> 00:07:45,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way...
has your sharpness gotten worse?</font>

84
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

85
00:07:51,570 --> 00:07:53,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to give up again
or something?</font>

86
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time I'll do it for you!</font>

87
00:07:57,450 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but I can't give up.</font>

88
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A man mustn't be protected
by a woman so...</font>

89
00:08:05,130 --> 00:08:08,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As usual you're a guy who's annoying
with the man-and-woman stuff.</font>

90
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you act tough it's totally obvious
that it's bravado, you idiot!</font>

91
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time you're taking sides
with the Leaf, huh?!</font>

92
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:26,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys sure are busy
all over the place!</font>

93
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She uses Genjutsu
with the sound of her flute.</font>

94
00:08:29,610 --> 00:08:30,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

95
00:08:36,910 --> 00:08:39,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cyclone Scythe Jutsu!</font>

96
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blowing away the sounds of the flute</font>

97
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and being able to nail the opponent
with a physical attack.</font>

98
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think she can attack and defend
with one hand...</font>

99
00:08:59,810 --> 00:09:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike me she has a nice Jutsu.</font>

100
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That woman's a natural enemy to me!</font>

101
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has Ukon... just about caught him
according to the strategy?</font>

102
00:09:53,070 --> 00:09:54,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Puppet, huh...?</font>

103
00:09:57,950 --> 00:10:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You three had been approaching
together, right?</font>

104
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:03,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two went on ahead.</font>

105
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are weak so...</font>

106
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot... These guys are
out of the ordinary!</font>

107
00:10:13,090 --> 00:10:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behind you!</font>

108
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't... move.</font>

109
00:10:24,010 --> 00:10:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this guy?</font>

110
00:10:28,230 --> 00:10:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave this to you, Sakon! Do it!</font>

111
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the other one?</font>

112
00:10:37,900 --> 00:10:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Who are you looking for?</font>

113
00:10:43,990 --> 00:10:46,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That state... I know!</font>

114
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:51,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful!
They enter the body and start to fuse!</font>

115
00:10:51,710 --> 00:10:53,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late.</font>

116
00:11:03,050 --> 00:11:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy!</font>

117
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Sakon?!</font>

118
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like...</font>

119
00:11:33,670 --> 00:11:36,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your Jutsu didn't work...
on the puppet.</font>

120
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a puppet too?!</font>

121
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me tell you this.</font>

122
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We the Sand Shinobi
aren't as lax as the Leaf.</font>

123
00:11:48,810 --> 00:11:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, don't be carelessly
approaching...</font>

124
00:11:57,780 --> 00:11:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Black Ant!</font>

125
00:12:04,370 --> 00:12:06,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was fearsome
when he was an enemy...</font>

126
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to think he'd be this dependable
when becoming an ally.</font>

127
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow... I got careless.
Let me rest in your body for a bit.</font>

128
00:12:53,750 --> 00:12:55,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good-for-nothing guy...</font>

129
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are these guys?</font>

130
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is their ability!</font>

131
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:03,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although you were caught off guard...</font>

132
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:06,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you getting hammered
by that puppet play...</font>

133
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

134
00:13:08,430 --> 00:13:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Its power and speed
are nothing special.</font>

135
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:14,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be beaten
by the likes of such a toy.</font>

136
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:25,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I was able
to heal my belly wound.</font>

137
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have much Chakra left...
but well</font>

138
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">these are opponents I should be able
to tear apart nevertheless.</font>

139
00:13:34,250 --> 00:13:39,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed it seems he's healed.
What a recovery ability he's got.</font>

140
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ordinarily I'm not the one
who becomes the main body</font>

141
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so it's hard to move, damn it.</font>

142
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure are mocking us...</font>

143
00:13:52,220 --> 00:13:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not an opponent
you can beat fighting head on!</font>

144
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should retreat for now and...</font>

145
00:13:58,270 --> 00:14:01,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't back down after having been
mocked you know.</font>

146
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me!</font>

147
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:41,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Black Ant isn't a Mechanism
for attacking.</font>

148
00:14:41,730 --> 00:14:44,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Primarily it's just for capturing.</font>

149
00:14:44,980 --> 00:14:49,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... Crow paired up with the Black Ant
is exclusively for attacking.</font>

150
00:14:50,610 --> 00:14:55,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you! Let me out!</font>

151
00:15:19,770 --> 00:15:21,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

152
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:23,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Puppet Show...</font>

153
00:15:23,940 --> 00:15:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, let me out! Let me out!</font>

154
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:30,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Secret Black Move Iron Maiden!</font>

155
00:15:58,430 --> 00:15:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The play is over.</font>

156
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She hid, huh...?</font>

157
00:16:12,740 --> 00:16:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or did she run away?</font>

158
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... That couldn't be...</font>

159
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:21,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just got here.</font>

160
00:16:22,250 --> 00:16:24,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Briefly explain the present situation,</font>

161
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">including an analysis of her ability
and battle style.</font>

162
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:32,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First off, her fundamental tactic is
ensnaring her opponent in Genjutsu</font>

163
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the sound of her flute.</font>

164
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then she delivers physical attacks
to that opening.</font>

165
00:16:39,350 --> 00:16:41,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Flute: Chains of Fantasia!</font>

166
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:52,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad! Is this Genjutsu?</font>

167
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't move my body...!</font>

168
00:17:01,950 --> 00:17:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe this was your last hand, right?</font>

169
00:17:05,670 --> 00:17:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately...
this is reversed checkmate!</font>

170
00:17:09,170 --> 00:17:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little rat!</font>

171
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:14,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a classic Genjutsu-style
distance range type.</font>

172
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most likely she must've seen your Jutsu
and figured out immediately</font>

173
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that it wouldn't mix well
with her own Jutsu.</font>

174
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's two against one too.</font>

175
00:17:23,310 --> 00:17:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She'll never appear before us again
until she casts her Genjutsu.</font>

176
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sound, huh...?</font>

177
00:17:30,690 --> 00:17:31,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

178
00:17:34,490 --> 00:17:37,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu generally appeal
to the five senses of people...</font>

179
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">sight, hearing, smell, taste, and touch.</font>

180
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The type that uses hearing
is the most troublesome of them all.</font>

181
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:56,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After she cleverly takes a distance on you
and then hides...</font>

182
00:17:56,720 --> 00:18:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have no idea where the Genjutsu
will be cast from or when.</font>

183
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The idea is for us to already be cast
by the Genjutsu</font>

184
00:18:03,970 --> 00:18:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by the time we've figured out where she is
by the sound of the flute...</font>

185
00:18:11,610 --> 00:18:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch...</font>

186
00:18:14,070 --> 00:18:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In my opinion, we're at an
overwhelming disadvantage.</font>

187
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A battle with this type essentially
wouldn't even be worth talking about</font>

188
00:18:23,290 --> 00:18:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without sensor types
like Kiba or Neji.</font>

189
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:30,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate we'll get pushed into a corner
sooner or later.</font>

190
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— We should just retreat...
— Who asked for your opinion?!</font>

191
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you to just explain the situation.</font>

192
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't misjudge my power...</font>

193
00:18:45,970 --> 00:18:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If she thinks
she's hiding well from me...</font>

194
00:18:48,690 --> 00:18:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in a distance enough for the sound
of her flute to reach...</font>

195
00:18:54,650 --> 00:18:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she's naive!</font>

196
00:18:56,690 --> 00:19:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning: Blade Dance</font>

197
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut!</font>

198
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:14,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

199
00:19:16,090 --> 00:19:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've made it this far.
It's about time for my Genjutsu...</font>

200
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

201
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:10,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it?</font>

202
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's done.</font>

203
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's sure... pushy.</font>

204
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's scarier than my mom.</font>

205
00:20:22,150 --> 00:20:23,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty good, huh?</font>

206
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But well...</font>

207
